<ul><li>Bullet<ul><li>Nested bullet<ul><li>Deep bullet</li></ul></li></ul></li><li>Back out</li></ul><ol type="I"><li>One</li><li>Two<ol type="A" start="3"><li>Two a</li></ol></li></ol>
<p>Between</p>
<ol type="I" start="3"><li>Three, continued</li></ol><ul><li class="check"><input type="checkbox" disabled="disabled" /> Open task</li><li class="check"><input type="checkbox" disabled="disabled" checked="checked" /> Done task<ol type="i"><li>Jumps to level two</li></ol></li></ul><ol type="I" start="5"><li>Restarted at five</li><li>Counts on from five<ol type="A" start="0"><li>Restarted deeper at zero</li></ol></li></ol><ul><li class="check"><input type="checkbox" disabled="disabled" checked="checked" /> Ticked, not struck</li></ul>
<p>A second paragraph of the item</p>
</body>
</html>
"
`;

